### 🚀 What I'm Currently Working On
- 📖 **Literaku:** Developing a voice-native digital reading platform leveraging Azure AI to empower visually impaired students with zero visual dependency.
- 🅿️ **LohParkir:** Building a smart parking management application focusing on QR validation and digital payment integration.
- 👾 **Game Development:** Crafting flood-themed pixel-art 2D games with custom physics and particle systems using Unity and C#.

